# Prune the build context. NOTE: .git is intentionally NOT excluded — the commit image must
# bake the full `mayhem` branch history (upstream + the additive integration commit) per SPEC
# §6.2 item 2 (mayhem.yml checks out with fetch-depth: 0).
**/__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
*.so
*.egg-info/
/build/
/dist/
/docs/_build/
/.pytest_cache/
/.cache/
/.coverage
/coverage.json
